        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書くと、偉人が現れる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write about your day or your worry": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "きょうのできごと・お悩みを書く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fitting great figure appears in your sky": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ふさわしい偉人が、あなたの空に現れる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A letter of reply arrives, with its source": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出典つきの返書が届く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every word has a source": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてのことばに、出典がある"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No invented quotes. Each letter tells you the work, the original language, and the era it comes from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "つくられた名言はありません。返書には作品名・原文の言語・成立年代を添えます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: the source of a letter from Seneca": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例: セネカからの返書の出典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With every letter, your night sky grows": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相談するたび、夜空に偉人が増えていく"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One free letter a day. Leave a small reflection each night, and watch your star atlas fill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 日 1 通は無料。毎晩の小さな内省が、あなたの星図になっていきます"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
